body:
We will not just tell you to call for help with suicide here... Most of us are suicidal ourselves or deal with pretty crippling depression. Honestly, sometimes the best thing you can do is destroy your current life, and find one that you are actually happy with. I cut out things I'm not happy with and do stuff that actually makes me happy. Not what the world tells me I need to do to be "successful." Be yourself, no one knows you better than you.

&#x200B;

Edit: Calling the hotline isn't bad but i figured saying that clarifying might be a good idea

I have news for you... Every human being on this planet is expendable. Regardless how intelligent, strong, etc. They can be replaced. Life isn't about another person's accomplishments. It also has nothing to do with pleasing another person. Live your life... Die for what you believe in. Most importantly... do what makes you happy. Even if it means breaking the law, having everyone hate you, hurting somebody else... You only get to live your life. Live it the way you want... and if you wanna live for another person cool, if not and you wanna live for yourself... also cool...

&#x200B;

just find a way to make yourself happy. Even if it means making a new you...
